docs {
  # Get All Hotels
  
  Retrieves a list of all hotels in the system.
  
  ## Response
  Returns a JSON object with a `hotels` array containing hotel IDs.
  
  ## Example Response
  ```json
  {
    "hotels": [
      {"id": 1},
      {"id": 2}
    ]
  }
  ```
}